{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1411032-what-happened-to-jiara-s-blog-entry","id":1411032,"title":"What happened to Jiara's blog entry?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-29T17:46:40-07:00","id":1411032,"title":"What happened to Jiara's blog entry?","content":"So, I'm interested in Jiara as a campaign setting. Browsing this forum, I've seen many references to material that gives a substantial amount of background for the place, as well as for Perfect Soul. This can't come from the Corebook, as the write-up is concise and no longer than two paragraphs. Yet it seems there are these lost texts that elaborate upon what I read in the Corebook. I don't know where any of this is. I found a link, dated in early 2016, to the former developer's &quot;blog&quot; that was housed on Facebook, but it no longer exists.<br /> <br /> My question, then, is: are there any copies of this deleted information stored somewhere? Are there sources I'm unaware of from which more knowledgeable forumites are drawing on?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1858-comrade-pointdexter","name":"Comrade Pointdexter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1858_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-29T18:12:27-07:00","id":1411036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Comrade Pointdexter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1411032-what-happened-to-jiara-s-blog-entry#post1411032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I'm interested in Jiara as a campaign setting. Browsing this forum, I've seen many references to material that gives a substantial amount of background for the place, as well as for Perfect Soul. This can't come from the Corebook, as the write-up is concise and no longer than two paragraphs. Yet it seems there are these lost texts that elaborate upon what I read in the Corebook. I don't know where any of this is. I found a link, dated in early 2016, to the former developer's &quot;blog&quot; that was housed on Facebook, but it no longer exists.<br /> <br /> My question, then, is: are there any copies of this deleted information stored somewhere? Are there sources I'm unaware of from which more knowledgeable forumites are drawing on?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> About this blog no idea, but possibly <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told\">of interest</a> to you. Also, wasn't there some stuff on Jiara in the Realm book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}